computer/gateway.py is adapted from packages/core/src/node/desktop-runtime.ts
(revokeTargetCommand, stopVncCommand, gatewayCommand, proxyEnvironmentCommand,
the view setup of renderEnsureScreenCommand, and interactiveScreenCommand).
Changes: ported from TypeScript to Python; fixed to one display (:1) and one
gateway port (6080); the browser and window manager steps dropped.
The terminal scripts in computer/gateway.py are adapted from the same file
(stopTerminalCommand and startTerminalCommand). Changes: ported to Python; the
program arrives on stdin instead of in the script.

computer/vendor/rakazo_terminal.py is TERMINAL_SERVER_PROGRAM from
packages/core/src/node/terminal-server.ts, copied unchanged.

computer/files.py is adapted from infra/sandboxes/supervisor/src/index.ts (the
files list and read scripts, and writeContainerFile). Changes: ported to Python;
the list leaves out the executable flag; the write takes base64 on stdin.

home_path in computer/models.py is adapted from normalizeWorkspaceRelative in
infra/sandboxes/supervisor/src/supervisor-logic.ts. Changes: ported to Python;
it also refuses a NUL character.

